  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 46,
      "at": [
        -2,
        -20
      ],
      "text": "From 15 V: a 7805 gives 5 V to a 100 ohm load; an LM317 gives 1.25 V x (1 + R/240 ohm), with R the\nrheostat RV1 (drag or scroll it while running); a TL431 with REF on K holds 2.5 V. Lower V1 below\n7 V to see the 7805 drop out, or set R1 to 1 ohm to reach its 1 A current limit."
    }
  ]
